notes = "GDD §10: the Dead Zone's Bad Dreams fused into one colossal nightmare. Weapons can't touch it and it swallows the light, but it can't reach the ceiling. Lure it close to a glowing fence generator, then smash the generator with a stomp or the dash: its EMP tears a chunk of the nightmare away, three times."
